  12   10   alloc_instance 5   (Report)

  11   11   load_var 3         (base)
       12   load_field 0       (score)
       13   load_var 2         (bonus)
       14   bin_op +           
       15   init_field 0       (score)

  14   16   load_var 3         (base)
